1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,065
Thank you for calling TC Telecom on this beautiful September Monday morning.

2
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:12,925
Currently, all of our operators are busy with other calls, however, if you'd be kind enough to wait on the line, one of our operators will be with you very shortly.

3
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:19,145
In the meantime, if you know the extension of the person you wish to contact, please press it on your phone now.

4
00:00:19,525 --> 00:00:22,745
If you are calling to check your account profile, please press 1.

5
00:00:23,445 --> 00:00:26,630
If you wish to delete or change a service, please press 2.

6
00:00:26,925 --> 00:00:30,125
If you would like to get in touch with our billing services, press 3.

7
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:39,405
If this is a call that needs the attention of a customer service representative, please continue holding, and talk to the operator.Thank you and we hope you have a great day.

8
00:00:39,885 --> 00:00:43,565
Remember, we here at TC Telecom value every call.
